type: software
title: "ube-ced: Cumulative Energy Demand of survival goods by Leontief input-output, with the Danish survival-floor model v5"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-26
authors:
  - family-names: Jogalekar
    given-names: Sourabh
    email: sourabhrj26@gmail.com
repository-code: https://github.com/djboy26/ube-ced
license: MIT
keywords:
  - cumulative energy demand
  - Leontief input-output
  - universal basic energy
  - thermodynamic cost of survival
  - decent living energy
  - Denmark
abstract: >
  Reference implementation of ε = e_d (I − A)⁻¹ for the primary cumulative energy demand of survival
  goods, and the Universal Basic Energy project's Danish survival-floor model v5, which sizes a
  per-person survival basket in primary kWh per year from Statistics Denmark input-output tables,
  a dwelling heat balance and dietary-guideline food quantities. Results are provisional and
  regenerate deterministically from source.
